    "title": "Distinguish not all from none",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-scope-negation-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Distinguish not all from none",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不都… denies that every member has the following property; it leaves open that some do. 都不… places the negation inside the description of every member. The position changes the range of the negative, not just the style.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这些人不都想打篮球。",
                "pinyin": "zhèxiē rén bù dōu xiǎng dǎ lánqiú 。",
                "meaning": "Not all these people want to play basketball.",
                "audio": "8ba11e4b329b0aa1398740b893b9c8501f86af83380c2283e988b09fb86e6ab3"
              },
              {
                "text": "这些人都不想打篮球。",
                "pinyin": "zhèxiē rén dōu bù xiǎng dǎ lánqiú 。",
                "meaning": "None of these people wants to play basketball.",
                "audio": "b19985a1826e6dae905a7748e3deddcb28c8e654ee07db1855cf84cc463950e8"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
